@page "/components/image-compare"

<PageTitle>Image Compare — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Image Compare</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">Before/after slider via <code>img-comparison-slider</code> WC (3KB), lazy-loaded.</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Horizontal</h2>
<Example Source="ImageCompareBasic.razor"><ImageCompareBasic /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Vertical</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>Orientation="Vertical"</code> slides up and down — the compiler passes the WC's own
    <code>direction</code> attribute, so the drag axis follows the label.
</p>
<Example Source="ImageCompareVertical.razor"><ImageCompareVertical /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Custom Position</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>InitialPosition</code> is the 0-100 starting point — 30 shows most of the after image,
    50 is a centred split.
</p>
<Example Source="ImageComparePosition.razor"><ImageComparePosition /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">No Labels</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>ShowLabels="false"</code> drops the Before/After chips — useful when the two sides are
    obvious, like a grayscale/colour pair.
</p>
<Example Source="ImageCompareNoLabels.razor"><ImageCompareNoLabels /></Example>
